{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56630","headline":"望岳（题拟） · 无名氏","name":"望岳（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（前缺）霜雪唯惜许，让王遁时澨。\n千乘不回虑，万金宁易节。\n美物忌芳坚，达人讳明哲。\n孤高霞月上，杳与氛埃绝。\n（见《分门纂类唐歌诗》卷二十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}